        "seg_cer": 0.071,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "清风徐来，秋天便有了秋的味道。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 26.139,
      "end": 30.068,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "即将处暑，处暑之后虽然白天还是有点热，",
      "score": 0.4056,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.6142,
        "sc_logprob": -0.6396,
        "sc_delta": -0.0255,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.521,
        "seg_cer": 0.294,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "即将出府，出府之后，虽然白天还是有点野。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 30.253,
      "end": 36.515,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "但是早晚比较凉快。处暑是二十四节气当中的第十四个节气，",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0044,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0051,
        "sc_delta": -0.0007,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "但是早晚比较凉快。处暑是二十四节气当中的第十四个节气。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 37.025,
      "end": 39.24,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "月令七十二候之改，",
