    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 72.922,
      "end": 76.835,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "处暑时节，人们应该早睡早起，保证睡眠充足，",
      "score": 0.0254,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0006,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0006,
        "sc_delta": -0.0001,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.056,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "初暑时节，人们应该早睡早起，保证睡眠充足。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 76.993,
      "end": 80.262,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "每天应该比夏季多睡一个小时。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0,
        "sc_delta": -0.0,
